          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": false,
            "title": "What is the main benefit of a robot lawn mower?",
            "text": "<p>Robot lawn mowers, like the popular <a href=\"/products/lawnmaster-l10-robotic-lawnmower\" title=\"LawnMaster L10 | Robot Lawn Mower - Up to 400m2\">LawnMaster L10</a>, utilise the latest technology to independently mow your lawn, freeing up your time to spend elsewhere.</p>",
