        "entry_9WQ9rH": {
          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": false,
            "title": "Which LawnMaster robot mower is best for me?",
            "text": "<p>LawnMaster <a href=\"/collections/ocumow\" title=\"OcuMow Robot Mowers\">OcuMow robot mowers</a> utilise a camera, sensors and Optical Grass Recognition (OGR) software to navigate around the lawn. These mowers are best suited for smaller lawns that have a defined border all around the edge of the lawn.</p><p>LawnMaster <a href=\"/collections/l-series\" title=\"L Series Robot Mowers\">L Series robot mowers</a> use a fixed boundary wire and sensors to navigate around the lawn. These mowers are best suited to medium and large lawns that feature more complex layouts, boundaries or have full borders.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "white",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "",
